{
  "title": "auth_basic 基础流程实测",
  "lines": [
    {"t": "note", "s": "nginx/1.31.5 容器实测，后端以静态页模拟"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -so /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\\n\" localhost"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "401"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -so /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\\n\" -u user1:password1 localhost"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "200"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -so /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\\n\" -u user1:wrong localhost"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "401"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "无凭证与错密码同为 401，正确凭证放行"}
  ]
}
